    <bpmn:process id="W_W1245" name="W1245. Customer Trade Account Credit Limit Periodic Review, Risk Scoring &amp; Adjustment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly credit review cycle; also triggered by significant payment pattern change (late payment, overlimit, collection escalation per W108)
Frequency: Annual for all ~5,200 trade accounts (anniversary cycle per W1300); quarterly automated scoring with manual review of flagged accounts only
Volume: ~5,200 trade accounts ÷ 4 quarters = ~1,300 reviews/quarter; ~5,200/year
Owner: Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Participants: Credit &amp; Collections Manager, Finance Manager, B2B Account Manager, Customer
Source: workflow W1245 — Customer Trade Account Credit Limit Periodic Review, Risk Scoring &amp; Adjustment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1245_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1245_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1245_Lane2" name="Credit &amp; Collections Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1245_Lane3" name="B2B Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1245_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1245_Start5" name="Quarterly credit review cycle; also triggered by significant payment pattern change (late…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1245_Task6" name="Automated risk scoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Automated risk scoring: System calculates updated risk score for each trade account: (a) payment history (on-time %, average days-to-pay, number of late payments in last 6 months); (b) current AR aging (current, 30+, 60+, 90+ days); (c) credit utilization (outstanding balance ÷ credit limit); (d) order frequency and value trend; (e) external data (if available: business registration status, SEC filing updates)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1245_Task7" name="Segmentation &amp; prioritization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Segmentation &amp; prioritization: System segments accounts: (a) increase recommended (utilization &gt;80%, good payment history, growing order trend); (b) maintain (stable metrics, utilization 30–80%); (c) decrease recommended (late payments increasing, utilization &gt;90%, declining order trend); (d) watch list (score dropped significantly, 60+ day aging); (e) immediate review (90+ day aging, overlimit)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Duration: 30 min/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1245_Task8" name="Individual account review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Individual account review: Credit &amp; Collections Manager reviews flagged accounts (increase/decrease/watch/immediate): (a) review payment history details; (b) review B2B Account Manager notes from W1240 project follow-ups; (c) check for open disputes or complaints per W41; (d) assess business relationship value (annual revenue, strategic importance)
Responsible (R): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15–20 min/account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1245_Task9" name="Credit limit decision">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Credit limit decision: For each reviewed account: (a) increase: justified by growth and good payment → raise limit (approval per tier: &lt;PHP 500K by Credit Manager, &lt;PHP 2M by Finance Manager, &gt;PHP 2M by CFO); (b) maintain: no change, continue monitoring; (c) decrease: justified by risk → lower limit (communicate to customer proactively via B2B Account Manager); (d) suspend: severe risk → suspend credit, convert to COD per W8
Responsible (R): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Manager / CFO
Duration: 10 min/decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1245_Task10" name="Customer communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer communication: B2B Account Manager communicates limit changes to customer: (a) for increases: positive news, reinforces relationship; (b) for decreases: explain reason (payment pattern, portfolio policy), offer path to restoration; (c) for suspension: formal notification, outstanding balance collection plan per W108
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Duration: 15 min/account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1245_Task11" name="System update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: System update: Update credit limit in ERP: (a) new limit effective immediately; (b) system enforces new limit on future orders; (c) if decrease: system allows existing committed orders to proceed (grandfathered) but blocks new orders exceeding new limit; (d) update credit scorecard per W893
Responsible (R): Credit &amp; Collections Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min/account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1245_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1245_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1245_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1245_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-286 (ensure controlled execution — Credit Application &amp; Scoring (PA-16.1).) | - operational: Credit &amp; Collections Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Credit &amp; Collections Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
